Strong adaptability: Compatible with various sizes of truck bodies, offering high versatility.','铁路车辆散货快速卸载
自动化运行控制
多重安全防护
适配不同车辆尺寸与作业需求','','','/assets/tzme-products/wagon-tippler.webp','published',0,0,'products','Wagon Tippler','Mining','Large machinery used for tipping and unloading, mainly used in railway transport to unload bulk materials such as coal, ore, grain, etc. It works by tilting the entire railcar to a certain angle, allowing the materials to be emptied from the car, thereby achieving fast and efficient unloading operations.','Large machinery used for tipping and unloading, mainly used in railway transport to unload bulk materials such as coal, ore, grain, etc. It works by tilting the entire railcar to a certain angle, allowing the materials to be emptied from the car, thereby achieving fast and efficient unloading operations.','mining','mining,lifting-transport',NULL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM app_migrations WHERE id='2026-10-15-official-products-v1') AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM site_content WHERE id='wagon-tippler');
INSERT INTO site_content (`id`,`title_en`,`title_zh`,`category_en`,`category_zh`,`summary_en`,`summary_zh`,`content_en`,`content_zh`,`features_en`,`features_zh`,`specifications_en`,`specifications_zh`,`image`,`status`,`show_on_home`,`home_order`,`type`,`title`,`category`,`summary`,`content`,`industry`,`industry_ids`,`date`) SELECT 'feeder','Feeder','给料机','Mining','矿山','A device used to transport materials evenly and continuously to subsequent processing equipment, widely used in industries such as mining, building materials, chemicals, and food.','向后续加工设备均匀、连续输送物料，可用于矿山、建材、化工及食品等行业，按粒度与湿度调节给料方式。','A device used to transport materials evenly and continuously to subsequent processing equipment, widely used in industries such as mining, building materials, chemicals, and food.','向后续加工设备均匀、连续输送物料，可用于矿山、建材、化工及食品等行业，按粒度与湿度调节给料方式。','Uniform Feeding: Utilizing advanced vibration or belt drive technology, it ensures uniform and continuous material transport, preventing material accumulation or interruptions in flow.
