Strong Adaptability: The feeding speed and method can be adjusted according to material characteristics (such as particle size and humidity), adapting to various material types.
High Durability: Key components are manufactured from high-strength materials, offering wear resistance and fatigue resistance for a long service life.
Environmentally Friendly and Energy-Saving: It uses energy-efficient motors and an optimized drive system to reduce energy consumption and meet environmental requirements.','振动或带式驱动，实现连续均匀给料
远程监测与调速，控制给料量
适配不同粒度及湿度物料
耐磨与抗疲劳部件
节能电机与传动优化','','','/assets/tzme-products/feeder.webp','published',0,0,'products','Feeder','Mining','A device used to transport materials evenly and continuously to subsequent processing equipment, widely used in industries such as mining, building materials, chemicals, and food.','A device used to transport materials evenly and continuously to subsequent processing equipment, widely used in industries such as mining, building materials, chemicals, and food.','mining','mining,lifting-transport',NULL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM app_migrations WHERE id='2026-10-15-official-products-v1') AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM site_content WHERE id='feeder');
